---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { site } from "../site.config";
import BackLink from "../components/BackLink.astro";
---

<Base title={`Privacy | ${site.name}`} >
  <BackLink />
  <h1 class="mt-1 font-display text-[44px] leading-none font-bold">Privacy</h1>

  <h2 class="mt-6 font-head text-xl font-bold text-balance">Who is responsible</h2>
  <p class="mt-2">{site.imprint.name}, {site.imprint.address.join(", ")}. Contact: {site.contactEmail}</p>

  <h2 class="mt-6 font-head text-xl font-bold text-balance">Visiting this site</h2>
  <p class="mt-2">
    This site is hosted by Vercel Inc. (USA). When you open a page, Vercel's servers process technical data such as your IP
    address, the time and the page requested, to deliver the site and keep it secure. Legal basis: our legitimate interest
    in running a working, secure site (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR). Vercel keeps these request logs for a short time only (one hour
    on the plan this site uses). Until you play a video, this site sets no cookies and loads no external fonts or scripts
    (see Videos).
  </p>

  <h2 class="mt-6 font-head text-xl font-bold text-balance">Visitor statistics</h2>
  <p class="mt-2">
    We use Vercel Web Analytics to count visits: which pages are viewed, the referring site, country, device type and
    browser. It works without cookies, stores nothing on your device and keeps no personal profiles; visitors are told
    apart only by an anonymous hash of the request that is reset every day, so visits cannot be linked across days or
    sites. We cannot see who you are. Legal basis: our legitimate interest in knowing which sessions are used
    (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR). The statistics are kept for at least one month.
  </p>

  <h2 class="mt-6 font-head text-xl font-bold text-balance">Videos</h2>
  <p class="mt-2">
    Each drill shows a video from YouTube (Google) that plays right on the page. Nothing is loaded from YouTube until you
    tap it, and if you never tap, no data goes to YouTube. When you tap, the player loads from youtube-nocookie.com:
    Google receives your IP address and device data, may store data in your browser while the video plays, and may show
    ads. Legal basis: your consent, given by tapping (Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR). If your browser has JavaScript switched off,
    the tap opens the video on YouTube instead, where YouTube's privacy policy applies.
  </p>

  <h2 class="mt-6 font-head text-xl font-bold text-balance">Feedback form</h2>
  <p class="mt-2">
    The feedback link opens a form at Tally (Tally BV, Belgium). Data goes to Tally only if you click that link. The form
    records which session you played and your answers; your email address is optional. Please do not enter names. Answers
    are stored at Tally and in a Google Sheet (Google) that only the operator of this site can read, and are used only to
    improve the sessions. Legal basis: your consent, given by sending the form (Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR). Answers are deleted
    once they are no longer needed for that purpose, at the latest after two years.
  </p>

  <h2 class="mt-6 font-head text-xl font-bold text-balance">Transfers outside the EU</h2>
  <p class="mt-2">
    Vercel and Google are based in the USA. Both are certified under the EU-US Data Privacy Framework, which the EU
    Commission recognises as providing an adequate level of protection (Art. 45 GDPR).
  </p>

  <h2 class="mt-6 font-head text-xl font-bold text-balance">Your rights</h2>
  <p class="mt-2">
    You can ask what we store about you and have it corrected, deleted or restricted, object to processing based on our
    legitimate interest, and withdraw a consent at any time with effect for the future (Art. 15 to 21 GDPR). Write to{" "}
    {site.contactEmail}. You can also complain to a data protection authority, in Berlin the Berliner Beauftragte für
    Datenschutz und Informationsfreiheit.
  </p>
</Base>
